    "# N-grams\n",
    "\n",
    "N-grams help us analyze the relationship between neighboring words in a sentence.\n",
    "\n",
    "N-grams = a sequence of N tokens (words or characters)\n",
    "\n",
    "N = 1 : Unigram\n",
    "N = 2 : Bigram\n",
    "N = 3 : Trigram\n",
    "N = 4 : N-gram\n",
    "N = 5 : N-gram\n",
    "...\n"
